sequenceDiagram
    %% =====================================================================
    %% Sprint Estudos-Habito-1 — Sequence POST /api/study-sessions
    %% Cobre 2 fluxos: (1) post-hoc completed, (2) live running + finalize
    %% Ref: spec RF-1, ADR-126 (schema), ADR-128 (streak), ADR-130 (auto_lesson)
    %% =====================================================================
    autonumber

    actor User as Usuario
    participant Form as StudyLogDialog
    participant API as POST /api/study-sessions
    participant Auth as requireAuth
    participant Zod as Zod discriminatedUnion
    participant Store as storage.createStudySession
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (tx)
    participant Streak as bumpStudyStreak (ADR-128)
    participant HUD as HUD timer sticky

    %% ===== Fluxo 1: Post-hoc (default) =====
    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
    Note over User,HUD: FLUXO 1 — Post-hoc (toggle "cronometrado" OFF)

    User->>Form: Abre dialog (FAB ou Cmd+K)
    Form->>Form: Pre-preenche com ultima session 7d
    User->>Form: Seleciona mode=lesson, theme, lesson_id, duration=45
    User->>Form: Click "Registrar"

    Form->>API: POST { mode, source: 'manual_post_hoc', status: 'completed',<br/>theme_id, lesson_id, duration_minutes: 45, ... }
    API->>Auth: JWT verify
    Auth-->>API: userId
    API->>Zod: parse(body) — discriminatedUnion(mode)

    alt Validation fail
        Zod-->>API: ZodError
        API-->>Form: 400 INVALID_INPUT { field, reason }
    else Valid
        Zod-->>API: payload
        API->>Store: createStudySession(userId, payload)
        Store->>DB: BEGIN
        Store->>DB: INSERT INTO study_sessions_v2 (...) RETURNING *
        DB-->>Store: session row
        Store->>Streak: bumpStudyStreak(tx, userId, registered_at)
        Streak->>DB: SELECT users.* FOR UPDATE
        Streak->>DB: SELECT SUM(duration_minutes) WHERE date=today
        Streak->>Streak: lazy reset freezes if month flipped
        Streak->>Streak: state machine (idempotent/inc/freeze/reset)
        Streak->>DB: UPDATE users SET streak, last_activity_at, freezes_used
        Streak-->>Store: { streakDays, todayMet, freezesRemaining, transition }
        Store->>DB: COMMIT
        Store-->>API: { session, streak }
        API-->>Form: 201 { session, streak: {...} }
        Form->>Form: Mostra toast "Streak: 7 dias  Meta: 45/45 min"
        Form->>User: Dialog fecha
    end
    end

    %% ===== Fluxo 2: Live cronometrado =====
    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
    Note over User,HUD: FLUXO 2 — Live (toggle "cronometrado" ON)

    User->>Form: Toggle "Comecar agora cronometrado" ON
    User->>Form: Seleciona mode=drill_gto, theme=ICM, drill_platform=gto_wizard
    User->>Form: Click "Registrar e Iniciar"

    Form->>API: POST { mode, source: 'manual_live', status: 'running',<br/>theme_id, drill_platform, started_at: now() }
    API->>Auth: JWT verify
    API->>Zod: parse — schema 'running' exige started_at NOT NULL ended_at NULL
    API->>Store: createStudySession(userId, payload)
    Store->>DB: BEGIN

    Note over Store,DB: Indice UNIQUE parcial uq_ssv2_user_running<br/>previne segunda session running por user
    Store->>DB: INSERT INTO study_sessions_v2 (status='running', ...)

    alt Outra session running
        DB-->>Store: PG 23505 unique_violation
        Store->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Store-->>API: SESSION_ALREADY_RUNNING
        API-->>Form: 409 SESSION_ALREADY_RUNNING
    else OK
        DB-->>Store: session row (status=running)
        Note over Streak: bumpStudyStreak NAO roda em status=running.<br/>Streak so atualiza no finalize.
        Store->>DB: COMMIT
        Store-->>API: session
        API-->>Form: 201 session running
        Form->>HUD: Inicializa HUD sticky "Estudando: ICM · 00:00:00"
        HUD->>User: Render HUD topo

        loop A cada 1s
            HUD->>HUD: tick — incrementa display
            User->>HUD: visibilitychange (>60s) detected
            HUD->>HUD: pause + push idle_period {start, end}
            User->>HUD: retorna
            HUD->>User: Dialog "Voce esteve fora 12min — descontar?"
            User->>HUD: Sim
        end

        User->>HUD: Click "Stop"
        HUD->>API: POST /api/study-sessions/:id/finalize<br/>{ ended_at, duration_minutes, idle_periods, was_productive, notes }
        API->>Auth: JWT verify
        API->>Store: finalizeStudySession(userId, sessionId, payload)
        Store->>DB: BEGIN
        Store->>DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE WHERE id=sessionId AND status='running' AND user_id=userId

        alt Session nao encontrada ou ja completada
            DB-->>Store: 0 rows
            Store->>DB: ROLLBACK
            Store-->>API: INVALID_STATE
            API-->>HUD: 409
        else OK
            Store->>DB: UPDATE status='completed', ended_at, duration_minutes recalc, ...
            Store->>Streak: bumpStudyStreak(tx, userId, started_at)
            Streak->>DB: FOR UPDATE + bump
            Streak-->>Store: { streakDays, ... }
            Store->>DB: COMMIT
            Store-->>API: { session, streak }
            API-->>HUD: 200 session completed
            HUD->>User: Toast "Sessao salva — Streak: 8 dias"
        end
    end
    end

    Note over User,DB: Edge case auto_lesson (Sprint 2 — ADR-130):<br/>Mux >=80% → POST com source='auto_lesson'<br/>Lookup janela 24h + UPDATE incremental se exists<br/>Sprint 1 aceita enum, sem trigger ativo.
